# Context History Applet Display Issues

The following screen scrape shows similar concerns to the output widget:

- boxes should be computed from available screen real-estate and should be the same size.  Their size governs the space available for rendering text, which should only elipse if:
  - the text exceeds the available space within the containing box AND the text is a collapsable object
  - text should not be elipsed mid-word.  Split on white space

